In file mode a UTF-16 file (with an `FF FE` byte order mark) is reported as not UTF-8 text and outln exits 1, while the other file argument is still outlined.
== args
input/utf16.md
input/ok.md
== file input/utf16.md escaped
\xff\xfec\x00o\x00n\x00s\x00t\x00 \x00a\x00 \x00=\x00 \x001\x00;\x00\
== file input/ok.md
# ok
== stdout
input/ok.md (1 line)
[L1-L1] # ok
== stderr
FILE input/utf16.md IS NOT UTF-8 TEXT
== exit 1
